            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbona ifarasi ibenjutse; kand’ ūyicayeko yitwa Rupfu, Kuzimu na we aramukurikira; bahabga ububasha ku kigira kane c’isi, ngo babicishe inkota n’inzara n’urupfu n’ibikōko vyo kw isi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.8",
